<p> BORROWER   GENERAL ELECTRIC CAPITAL CORP</p>
<p> AMT    200 MLN DFL   COUPON     5.0 PCT   MATURITY    27.DEC.01</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  101.235   PAY DATE   L17.OCT.96</p>
